cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "dreamlite-stream"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper below."
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Yoshiyuki
    family-names: Ootani
abstract: >-
  Video-rate streaming stylization runtime on the smallest
  vision-aware MLLM-conditioned edit-diffusion stack
  (DreamLite-mobile + Qwen3-VL). Implements an asymmetric
  side-stream / main-stream CUDA pipeline, a compile-friendly
  Temporal LLLite adapter, a periodic cond-refresh and hook-subset
  schedule, and the full evaluation harness used in the
  accompanying paper.
license: Apache-2.0
preferred-citation:
  type: article
  title: >-
    Inverting the Streaming-Diffusion Bottleneck: Video-Rate
    MLLM-Conditioned Edit Diffusion on a Consumer GPU
  authors:
    - given-names: Yoshiyuki
      family-names: Ootani
  year: 2026
  notes: Preprint
